{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"panel","title":"Panel Data: Fixed & Random Effects","totalStages":30,"modules":[{"id":"panel-heterogeneity","title":"1 · Panel data & unobserved heterogeneity","summary":"What panel data is, why repeated observations on the same entities help, and how an unobserved entity effect αᵢ creates correlation that biases naive regression.","stageCount":6,"stages":[{"id":"panel-heterogeneity-01","index":0,"moduleId":"panel-heterogeneity","moduleIndex":0,"type":"read","title":"What makes data 'panel' data","skillIds":["panel.panel-structure"],"estimatedMinutes":6,"difficulty":"advanced","points":5},{"id":"panel-heterogeneity-02","index":1,"moduleId":"panel-heterogeneity","moduleIndex":1,"type":"read","title":"Why αᵢ is dangerous: unobserved heterogeneity","skillIds":["panel.pooled-bias"],"estimatedMinutes":6,"difficulty":"advanced","points":5},{"id":"panel-heterogeneity-03","index":2,"moduleId":"panel-heterogeneity","moduleIndex":2,"type":"code","title":"Build a balanced panel and look at it","skillIds":["panel.panel-structure"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"difficulty":"advanced","points":10},{"id":"panel-heterogeneity-04","index":3,"moduleId":"panel-heterogeneity","moduleIndex":3,"type":"quiz","title":"Check: what is αᵢ?","skillIds":["panel.pooled-bias"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"difficulty":"advanced","points":15},{"id":"panel-heterogeneity-05","index":4,"moduleId":"panel-heterogeneity","moduleIndex":4,"type":"quiz","title":"Check: when does αᵢ cause bias?","skillIds":["panel.panel-structure"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"difficulty":"advanced","points":15},{"id":"panel-heterogeneity-06","index":5,"moduleId":"panel-heterogeneity","moduleIndex":5,"type":"fillblank","title":"Name the hidden entity effect","skillIds":["panel.pooled-bias"],"estimatedMinutes":4,"difficulty":"advanced","points":15}]},{"id":"panel-pooled-bias","title":"2 · Pooled OLS and its bias","summary":"Pooled OLS ignores the panel structure and treats αᵢ as part of the error. We show, in code and wit